meta {
  name: Get Trending
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/tmdb/trending?type=all&window=week&language={{language}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  type: all
  window: week
  language: {{language}}
}

docs {
  # Get Trending Content

  Fetches trending movies, TV shows, or all content from TMDB for the specified time window.

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `type` | `string` | No | `all` | Media type: `movie`, `tv`, or `all`. |
  | `window` | `string` | No | `week` | Time window: `day` or `week`. |
  | `language` | `string` | No | `en-US` | Localization language tag. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Paginated TMDB trending list.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

